      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Maybe there could be a way to indicate that somebody is streaming, but I'd avoid giving out 'titles' to know streamers because of multiple reasons;\n\nIt doesn't do much apart from segregate streamers from non streamers\nIt makes streamers easy targets for malicious attacks\nIt would clutter up the nametag area\n\nMy suggestion: allow a mode you can toggle where you can indicate that you are streaming, such as like a red flashing dot on the side of a nametag. I think there should also be an option where you can block your avatar to people who are streaming in case you don't want to be seen on a stream. However this would be dependant on people turning on the mode before they start a stream.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
