  "details": "I would love to have a feature to support some of your bigger streamers. Maybe set an application process and you guys could scout for the streamers who have been trying to put stuff out for you guys. Just like the mods having game on the left of their name tag instead of Saying mod of course it would say streamer or something of the sort.  I believe this would potential he make people want to stream your game and give the game more  Publicity.  As long as you make the application hard-core and you actually have someone come on these peoples streams and scout. :)",
